<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="de">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Nachricht gesendet / Message sent – weltraumtrips.com</title>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">

  <style>
    :root {
      --primary: #2b4eff;
      --bg: #0b0f1a;
      --card-bg: #141a29;
      --accent: #4f7cff;
    }

    body {
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: #ffffff;
      margin: 0;
      opacity: 0;
      animation: fadeIn 0.8s ease forwards;
    }

    @keyframes fadeIn {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); }
      to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }

    header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1f33, #0b0f1a);
      color: #fff;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 40px 15px;
    }

    header h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 2.4rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    }

    header p {
      margin: 8px 0 0;
      font-size: 1rem;
      opacity: 0.9;
    }

    main {
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 40px auto;
      background: var(--card-bg);
      padding: 40px 30px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      box-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
      text-align: center;
    }

    .icon {
      font-size: 3.8rem;
      color: var(--primary);
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    h2 {
      color: var(--accent);
      margin-top: 0;
      font-size: 1.7rem;
    }

    p {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin: 10px 0 20px;
    }

    hr {
      margin: 35px 0;
      border: none;
      border-top: 1px solid #2b4eff;
    }

    a.button {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 25px;
      padding: 12px 20px;
      background: var(--primary);
      color: #fff;
      border-radius: 999px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 600;
      transition: background 0.15s ease, transform 0.15s ease;
    }

    a.button:hover {
      background: #1f3bcc;
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: #aaa;
      padding: 20px 10px 30px;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
  <h1>weltraumtrips.com</h1>
  <p>Premium-Domain – Kontaktbestätigung / Contact confirmation</p>
</header>

<main>
  <div class="icon">✔️</div>

  <h2>Nachricht erfolgreich gesendet</h2>
  <p>
    Vielen Dank für Ihre Anfrage!<br>
    Ich werde mich so bald wie möglich bei Ihnen melden.
  </p>

  <hr>

  <h2>Message successfully sent</h2>
  <p>
    Thank you for your inquiry!<br>
    I will get back to you as soon as possible.
  </p>

  <a href="index.html" class="button">Zurück zur Hauptseite / Back to main page</a>
</main>

<footer>
  Verkaufsseite / Sales page for the domain weltraumtrips.com
</footer>

</body>
</html>
